<title>UK: Copper nears highs in LME ring, July date nears.</title>
<headline>Copper nears highs in LME ring, July date nears.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Slightly higher. Focus on spreads ahead of Monday's &quot;3rd Wednesday&quot; pricing. July/one day trades at $13 backwardation.</p>
<p>LEAD - Holding steady above $660.</p>
<p>ZINC - Off slightly, Sept/threes trades at $12 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Slightly lower, market absorbs 6,900-tonne stock rise.</p>
<p>TIN - Quietly steady. NICKEL - Holding stable.</p>
</text>
